---
description: Loads the canonical agent briefing and rules from AGENTS.md
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` in the repository root. It is the canonical briefing
for any agent on this project — build commands, architecture, asmjit
notes, and the full rule index. All content there applies to work
done through Cursor.

The `.claude/rules/*.md` files contain bare imperatives; sibling
`docs/rules/*.md` files contain the reasoning. Read the rules that
apply to your current task before editing.
